        <briefdescription>
<para>Run the round-trip relay. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Run.</para>
<para>Executes <computeroutput>config.num_round_trips</computeroutput> complete forward→backward cycles using the provided <computeroutput>edit_pairs</computeroutput> (cycling if there are fewer pairs than rounds). When <computeroutput>num_round_trips == 0</computeroutput> the function returns immediately with RS@0 = 1.0 and <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1rag_1_1delegate__eval_1a108125b3ca005e1e3b5f6b4763ca770aa2aa4029d1e4c1e0f0d8febd58c9afe33" kindref="member">StopReason::COMPLETED_NORMALLY</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>seed_doc</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Original document before any edits. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>edit_pairs</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Ordered list of edit pair instructions. Must not be empty unless <computeroutput>num_round_trips == 0</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>evaluator</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Domain-specific scorer used after each backward edit. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>edit_fn</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Callable that applies a single edit instruction to a document. Must be non-null. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1delegate__eval_1_1_relay_result" kindref="compound">RelayResult</ref></computeroutput> containing full RS history and metadata.</para>
</simplesect>
