    <briefdescription>
<para>Orchestrates forward→backward round-trip edits and measures RS@k. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For each round trip, the simulator:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Calls <computeroutput>edit_fn(current_doc, pair.forward_instruction)</computeroutput> → <computeroutput>forward_doc</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Calls <computeroutput>edit_fn(forward_doc, pair.backward_instruction)</computeroutput> → <computeroutput>backward_doc</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Evaluates <computeroutput>evaluator.evaluate(seed_doc, backward_doc)</computeroutput> → RS.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Appends RS to <computeroutput>RelayResult::scores.rs_per_interaction</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>An exception from <computeroutput>edit_fn</computeroutput> records RS = 0.0 and sets <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1rag_1_1delegate__eval_1a108125b3ca005e1e3b5f6b4763ca770aac4f16930bbe97be0ecda8ae843de8c03" kindref="member">StopReason::EDIT_FAILED</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><bold>Thread safety:</bold> not shared; create one instance per concurrent request.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>AgenticRAG for the analogous iterative-retrieval design. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
